atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region dom block -0.009 0.009 -0.009 0.009 -0.001 0.004 units box
create_box 1 dom
neighbor 0.0002 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix p1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 100000000.0
fix p2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix p3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix p4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.5
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history twisting_marshall on
pair_coeff * *
fix plate all mesh/surface file plate.stl type 1
fix mv all move/mesh mesh plate rotate origin 0 0 0 axis 0 0 1 period 0.3141592653589793
fix w all wall/gran model hertz tangential history mesh n_meshes 1 meshes plate twisting_marshall on
create_atoms 1 single 0 0 0.00099999000000000008 units box
set atom * diameter 0.002 density 2500.0
fix gravi all gravity 9.81 vector 0 0 -1
timestep 1e-6
fix integr all nve/sphere
compute om all property/atom omegaz
compute oms all reduce sum c_om
variable z1 equal z[1]
thermo_style custom step v_z1 c_oms
thermo_modify format float %.17g norm no
thermo 200
run 20000
set atom 1 omegaz 0.0
run 300000
